From 60eecafe3f40041efdb801886dfaa50a13f41335 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert DeLanghe <1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:27:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(opencode): read, list, glob and grep no longer become
 file changes (pr/63)

The tool-input fallback ran for every tool with a path-shaped input and mapped
the unknown names to touch. Only FileWrite tools now. Snapshots re-recorded and
reviewed; the opencode contract and pr/56 drop the wrong failed-read entry.
